{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a new Shopify Online Store 2.0 section with a two-column editorial layout in the Bonne Soirée style — minimal, timeless, refined, and inspired by luxury fashion editorials.
    
    Purpose:
    
    Display one editorial image alongside structured text content.
    
    The section should be fully customizable from the Shopify Theme Editor without requiring code changes.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    LAYOUT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Desktop:
    
    • Two-column layout.
    • Image on the left.
    • Text on the right.
    • Columns should have balanced proportions.
    • The text block must always be vertically centered relative to the image.
    • Keep subtle spacing between image and text (clean editorial composition).
    • Plenty of white space, but never excessive.
    • Maximum section width around 1280px.
    • Center the entire section horizontally.
    
    Mobile:
    
    • Stack the image above the text.
    • Keep proportional spacing between the image and text.
    • Maintain generous side padding.
    • Preserve the selected text alignment.
    • Fully responsive.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    IMAGE
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Support independent Desktop and Mobile images.
    
    Settings:
    
    • Desktop image picker.
    • Mobile image picker.
    • If no mobile image is uploaded, automatically display the desktop image.
    
    Image behavior:
    
    • Preserve the original aspect ratio.
    • width: 100%.
    • height: auto.
    • object-fit: contain.
    • Never crop the image.
    • No rounded corners.
    • No borders.
    • No shadows.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    TEXT CONTENT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Create THREE independent Rich Text blocks.
    
    Each block should be individually editable.
    
    Block 1
    Main Title
    
    Block 2
    First Subtitle
    
    Block 3
    Second Subtitle / Body Text
    
    Each text block must support Shopify Rich Text formatting.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    TYPOGRAPHY CONTROLS
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Each text block must have its own independent typography settings inside the Theme Editor.
    
    For EACH of the three text blocks include:
    
    • Shopify Font Picker (font family)
    • Font size
    • Font weight
    • Letter spacing
    • Line height
    
    Do not hardcode fonts.
    
    Default font:
    Times New Roman (or the store's primary serif font).
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    TEXT ALIGNMENT
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Create one global Text Alignment setting.
    
    Options:
    
    • Left
    • Center
    • Right
    
    Default:
    
    Center
    
    The selected alignment must apply to all three text blocks.
    
    When Center is selected:
    
    • The entire text composition must be centered inside the right column.
    • Not only the text itself, but the whole text group.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    TEXT SPACING
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Include adjustable spacing controls for:
    
    • Title → Subtitle 1
    • Subtitle 1 → Subtitle 2
    
    Allow independent spacing values.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    BACKGROUND
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Background color selector.
    
    Default colors:
    
    • #FFFFFF
    • #F9F8F5
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    SECTION SPACING
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Include editable controls for:
    
    • Top padding
    • Bottom padding
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    OPTIONAL LAYOUT SETTINGS
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Include a Layout Direction selector.
    
    Options:
    
    • Image Left / Text Right (default)
    • Text Left / Image Right
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    STYLE
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    The overall feeling should be elegant, minimal and editorial.
    
    Inspired by luxury fashion brands such as Toteme, Khaite, The Row and Sézane.
    
    The composition should resemble a printed fashion magazine.
    
    Use generous but balanced white space.
    
    The typography should feel premium and timeless.
    
    The section must be fully responsive and compatible with Shopify Online Store 2.0.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    BUTTON
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Include the existing Bonne Soirée Custom Button directly inside this section.
    
    Do NOT create a new button design.
    
    Reuse the exact same custom button component already created for the Bonne Soirée theme, preserving all existing functionality, styling, schema settings and hover behavior.
    
    The button must appear directly below the text content (Main Title → First Subtitle → Second Subtitle), inside the same text wrapper on the right column.
    
    The button must never render outside the text column or below the entire section.
    
    Keep all existing button functionality, including:
    
    • Optional heading
    • Button text
    • Button link
    • Text color
    • Background color
    • Border color
    • Border thickness
    • Alignment (left, center, right)
    • Top padding
    • Bottom padding
    
    Keep the existing button styling exactly as implemented:
    
    • Rectangular shape
    • No border-radius
    • Times New Roman font
    • Serif typography
    • Regular font weight (400)
    • Uppercase text
    • Minimal editorial appearance
    
    Keep the existing hover interaction exactly as implemented:
    
    • Background changes to black (#000000)
    • Text changes to off-white (#F5F1EB)
    • Border changes to black
    • transition: all 0.3s ease;
    
    Do not recreate or restyle the button.
    
    Simply embed the existing Bonne Soirée custom button component inside this editorial section so it behaves exactly like the standalone version., Button Typography
    
    Add an independent Shopify Font Picker for the button.
    
    The button must have its own typography settings inside the Theme Editor, including:
    
    • Shopify Font Picker (font_picker)
    • Font size
    • Font weight
    • Letter spacing
    • Line height
    • Text transform (uppercase or none)
    
    Default font:
    Times New Roman (or the store's primary serif font).
    
    Do not hardcode the font-family.
    
    The button must use the selected font from the Shopify Font Picker.
{% enddoc %}

{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.background_color }};
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 40px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }

  .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-editorial-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    order: 2;
  }

  .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    order: 1;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 400px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 500px;
    max-height: 500px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_alignment }};
    gap: {{ block.settings.spacing_title_subtitle1 }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.title_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.title_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-editorial-subtitle1-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subtitle1_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.subtitle1_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subtitle1_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle1_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.subtitle1_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.subtitle1_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.spacing_title_subtitle1 }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-subtitle2-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subtitle2_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.subtitle2_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subtitle2_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle2_font_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.subtitle2_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.subtitle2_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.spacing_subtitle1_subtitle2 }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.button_top_padding }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.button_bottom_padding }}px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.button_alignment }};
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-editorial-button-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font_weight }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.button_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.button_line_height }};
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.button_text_transform }};
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    text-align: {% if block.settings.button_alignment == 'flex-start' %}left{% elsif block.settings.button_alignment == 'flex-end' %}right{% else %}center{% endif %};
  }

  .ai-editorial-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 12px 32px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: {{ block.settings.button_border_thickness }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font_weight }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.button_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.button_line_height }};
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.button_text_transform }};
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .ai-editorial-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: #000000;
    color: #F5F1EB;
    border-color: #000000;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-editorial-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-editorial-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 1;
    }

    .ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }}.ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }} .ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      order: 2;
    }

    .ai-editorial-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-editorial-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
    }

    .ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: 300px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<ai-editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-editorial-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-editorial-grid-{{ ai_gen_id }} {% if block.settings.layout_direction == 'text_left' %}ai-editorial-reverse-{{ ai_gen_id }}{% endif %}">
      
      <div class="ai-editorial-image-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.image_desktop %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 2000 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.height }}"
            class="ai-editorial-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-image-desktop-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.image_mobile %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.image_mobile | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.image_mobile.height }}"
            class="ai-editorial-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
        {% elsif block.settings.image_desktop %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.image_desktop | image_url: width: 1000 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.alt | escape }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.width }}"
            height="{{ block.settings.image_desktop.height }}"
            class="ai-editorial-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-editorial-image-mobile-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      <div class="ai-editorial-text-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.title != blank %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.title }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.subtitle1 != blank %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-subtitle1-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.subtitle1 }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.subtitle2 != blank %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-subtitle2-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.subtitle2 }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.button_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <div>
              {% if block.settings.button_heading != blank %}
                <div class="ai-editorial-button-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                  {{ block.settings.button_heading }}
                </div>
              {% endif %}
              <a href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}" class="ai-editorial-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {{ block.settings.button_text }}
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</ai-editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class AiEditorialSection{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
      }
    }

    customElements.define('ai-editorial-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}', AiEditorialSection{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

{% schema %}
